[[Chromatic Sap]] is the map-specific collectible [[token]] from [[Shipwreck Strand]]. {{item icon|Chromatic Sap}} and {{item icon|Aether-Rich Sap}} can be converted at a 1:5 ratio with no limit:
* Consuming 1 Chromatic Sap awards 5 Aether-Rich Sap.
* 5 Aether-Rich Sap can be used to purchase 1 Chromatic Sap at any Castoran renown vendor.

== Acquisition ==
=== Gathered from ===
* Small chance to be gathered from any [[Gathering#Resource nodes|resource node]] in [[Shipwreck Strand]] with the [[Resourcefulness]] [[mastery]] unlocked.
